Welcome to StrataPHP Logging System
---------------------------------
This logging systemn uses Levels: 
         Dev: 'log_level' => 'DEBUG' - DEBUG, INFO, WARNING, ERROR
     Staging: 'log_level' => 'INFO' - INFO, WARNING, ERROR
  Production: 'log_level' => 'WARNING' - WARNING, ERROR only
See Config for more details on how to set log levels and configure logging.
